er.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}}}, "com.freedomfighter.retreatwalk": {"metadata": {"added": 1785406002000, "categories": ["Time"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/funkypitt/retreat-walk/issues", "lastUpdated": 1785406002000, "license": "MIT", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/funkypitt/retreat-walk", "authorName": "funkypitt", "name": {"en-US": "Retreat Walk"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Rings a bell every so many minutes, until you stop it"}, "description": {"en-US": "Retreat Walk rings a singing bowl at a fixed interval — every 10 minutes, say —\nover and over until you stop it. For switching partners in a paired meditation\nexercise, and for sitting with a regular reminder to stay awake.\n\nOne number and one button. That is the whole app.\n\n* Set the minutes between bells and press Start. The bell rings at that many\n  minutes, then at twice, then three times, and on and on.\n* Press Stop in the app, or on the notification, and the session ends.\n* The screen shows a countdown to the next bell and how many have rung.\n\nIt rings on time:\n\n* Every bell is an exact alarm, the same mechanism the phone's own Clock app\n  uses, so it fires even when the device is locked, asleep or in power-saving\n  Doze.\n* The session runs in a foreground service holding a wake lock, so the system\n  cannot mute the bowl or kill it partway through.\n* Bells are timed from the start of the session rather than from the previous\n  bell, so an hour in they have not drifted away from the clock.\n* The notification is silent and carries a Stop action — the bowl is the only\n  sound the app ever makes, which is what a quiet room needs.\n\nThe bell is a single strike of the Satipanya bowl, shared with Retreat Timer.\n\nNo ads, no tracking, no accounts, and no network permission at all.\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.freedomfighter.retreatwalk/en-US/icon_La58mlAoKz3n-RPwOFk-LkKzKWE2FWbAM0vuCu4b00s=.png", "sha256": "2dae7c9a50282b3de7f913f038593e2e42b32961361566c0334bee0aee1bd34b", "size": 8650}}, "preferredSigner": "9b6ae69650b1ccf5bfa08ad15dc8b412622b8e5a3202ea066215067897a2be28"}, "versions": {"0fd016441dd7d8f9c10ffd104a2981bff77bd8f1ab8550284836313f6ba59a80": {"added": 1785406002000, "file": {"name": "/RetreatWalk-v1.0.0.apk", "sha256": "0fd016441dd7d8f9c10ffd104a2981bff77bd8f1ab8550284836313f6ba59a80", "size": 9871064}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "1.0.0", "versionCode": 1, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 34}, "signer": {"sha256": ["9b6ae69650b1ccf5bfa08ad15dc8b412622b8e5a3202ea066215067897a2be28"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM"}, {"name": "android.permission.USE_EXACT_ALARM"}, {"name": "android.permission.WAKE_LOCK"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MEDIA_PLAYBACK"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "com.freedomfighter.retreatwalk.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}}}, "dev.wath.openlibeextendedeinkremix": {"versions": {"e307c5ebff04f46551315756a9766768ca1a1d5efc51f1939097cedc5487f886": null, "f8c3507d2be381dfc5c5ddc31b0ca64d345e8e24400cc474ad3f22e7f81ab57e": {"added": 1774210436000, "file": {"name": "/OpenLibeExtended-eInk-Remix.apk", "sha256": "f8c3507d2be381dfc5c5ddc31b0ca64d345e8e24400cc474ad3f22e7f81ab57e", "size": 91303016}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86_64"], "versionName": "1.3.3", "versionCode": 2021, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 24, "targetSdkVersion": 36}, "signer": {"sha256": ["9b6ae69650b1ccf5bfa08ad15dc8b412622b8e5a3202ea066215067897a2be28"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.WAKE_LOCK"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_MEDIA_IMAGES"}, 